<pb n="114" facs="#f0126"/>
<fw type="header" place="top">Die kün&#x017F;tlichen Sy&#x017F;teme und die Nomenclatur</fw><lb/>
<list><item><hi rendition="#aq">1. Creator T. O. in primordio vestiit Vegetabile <hi rendition="#g">me</hi>-<lb/>
<hi rendition="#g">dullare</hi> principiis constitutivis diversi corticalis,<lb/>
unde tot difformia individua, quot ordines naturales,<lb/>
