<hi rendition="#g">Jacob Chri&#x017F;tian Schaeffer</hi> <note place="foot" n="2)">Jacob Chri&#x017F;tian <hi rendition="#g">Schaeffer</hi>, geb. 1718, ge&#x017F;t. 1790, war Superinten-<lb/>
