<p>Die Entdeckungen <hi rendition="#g">Prie&#x017F;tley</hi>'s, <hi rendition="#g">Ingen</hi>-<hi rendition="#g">Houß</hi>' und<lb/>
<hi rendition="#g">Senebier</hi>'s, die quantitativen Be&#x017F;timmungen <hi rendition="#g">Sau&#x017F;&#x017F;ure</hi>'s<lb/>
